{
 "version": 3,
 "about": [
  "Explicit map from QuantiSheet AI Takeoff result lines to the human takeoff groups (Group_ID) in the reviewer's Colleton_Human_vs_AI_Comparison.xlsx, sheet Mapping (Colleton County EOC). Same rules and format as tools/aiken_map.json; read by tools/aiken_eval.py --set colleton.",
  "Quantities only. No prices, no cost data.",
  "v1 (Oct 27): empty start - rules are added from the first run's ai_lines.csv against the Mapping groups.",
  "v1: first mapping from the 0.13.10-dev run's lines (Oct 27). Only lines that are plainly the same item as a human group; untagged review lines left unmapped.",
  "v2: fire alarm devices (now counted on the fire alarm plan), occupancy sensors, and the HVAC equipment marks (IFC, IHP, OHP, EF, SF, KH) mapped.",
  "v3: wall types read from the information floor plan (A-101): Wall Type 1 / 2 LF to H09-WT1 / H09-WT2; the exterior wall length scored once, from the outer face loop (walls:Exterior Walls -> H09-EXTWALL); types 4 and 5 (the exterior walls) listed as info."
 ],
